	decrypt itself. The application refuses to save this key to the table and
	refuses to resolve it through a template tag.
	Leave it out and MFA enrollment is turned off; existing secrets stay
	unreadable until the key is restored, so keep a backup of it with your
	other credentials. Changing it forces every user to enrol again.
*/
